    "detailed_description": "Step into the role of the ruler of your own medieval settlement, manage and develop it in real-time from a first-person perspective.<br><br>Switch between 4 modes (<i>Free</i>, <i>Building</i>, <i>Ruler</i>, and <i>Combat</i>) to have simple control over everything around you.<br><br>Protect the Town Hall, which is the center of your settlement, and prevent the enemy from destroying it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348440/extras/9ac6a3521654241cb28302125ae2df31.webp?t=1746039740\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348440/extras/16c5b302e68edee7ad66f158c6d13ed6.poster.avif?t=1746039740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348440/extras/16c5b302e68edee7ad66f158c6d13ed6.webm?t=1746039740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348440/extras/16c5b302e68edee7ad66f158c6d13ed6.mp4?t=1746039740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Extract 5 types of resources.<br></li><li> Receive golden chests for developing your settlement.<br></li><li> Produce arrows in the archery workshop.<br></li><li> Look for berry bushes to provide food for your subjects.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348440/extras/9d1253da3e86e7c54a024ddf9cab4a35.webp?t=1746039740\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348440/extras/dc0cd74e44ab6a331336bec9450189f0.poster.avif?t=1746039740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets